            "x": 350,
            "y": 610,
            "width": 380,
            "height": 120,
            "text": "λ AWS Lambda Function\n\n1️⃣ Convert (lat, lon) → Quadkey\n2️⃣ Query CSV → Find S3 path for quadkey\n3️⃣ Fetch only matching .geojson.gz from S3\n4️⃣ Decompress + Search polygon containing point\n5️⃣ Return matching GeoJSON polygon",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "strokeColor": "#c2410c"
